# Files GitHub Pages publishes. Nothing else in this repo is served.
# Line types:  path or glob = published (a line containing *, ? or [ is a
# glob; a * never crosses a / and never matches a leading dot; a glob must
# match a file) · !path = known, deliberately not published · @prefix/ = a
# watched area: every tracked file under it must match a line above, or the
# Pages run fails "UNCOVERED". A symlink anywhere in a listed path, or a
# tracked symlink in a watched area, is refused.
# Pages runs from GitHub Actions (switched 2026-09-29): a run that stages
# deploys the allowlisted files, even when coverage then turns it red.
# Writers: the daily status routine (data/status.json, data/.last-check) and
# the monthly Learning Matrix routine (learning-matrix.html only).
# Only simple [ ] sets ([abc], [!x], [^x]) are allowed, and no wildcard on an @
# line; pages.yml's header lists everything that stops a deploy.
index.html
learning-matrix.html
starter-story.html
# The page's live cells fetch this on every load, so it must be published.
data/status.json
!data/.last-check
# Response tiers for the daily check; not published. triage/ is outside every
# watched area and has no line, so it is never published (a ! glob would fail
# the run while the folder is empty).
!bands.yaml
@data/
